# arvo-storage

Minimal L0 storage primitives for arvo. Hosts the only fielded
primitive types in arvo: `Bits<N, S>` (the N-bit storage
primitive), the strategy markers (`Hot`, `Warm`, `Cold`, `Precise`),
and the platform-binding wrappers `Bool` and `USize`, plus the
niche-packed `NUSize` (transparent maybe-of-USize at single-usize
layout). Plus the typed meta-bit newtypes (`IBits`, `FBits`, `Width`)
used as `ConstParamTy_` carriers for const-generic positions across
the stack. `#![no_std]`, no alloc.
